{
  "ai_search": {
    "description": "Get AI-generated insights by asking natural language questions about workspace data.\n\nWHEN TO CALL:\n- User asks \"What were sales last quarter?\" or similar data questions\n- User wants insights/analysis without knowing exact metric names\n- User needs quick answers about workspace data\n- NOT for creating visualizations (use ai_chat instead)\n\nDEFAULT BEHAVIOR:\n- Searches through metrics, attributes, and visualizations in the workspace\n- Returns AI-generated insights based on available data\n- Scoped to current workspace with user's permissions\n\nReturns:\n    AiSearchResponse containing:\n    - results: Structured AI search results and insights\n    - question: The original question that was asked\n    - message: Human-readable status message\n\nRaises:\n    ValidationError: If question missing or empty.\n    ServiceError: If AI Search API unavailable.\n      \u2192 Recovery: Rephrase question or verify workspace has data\n\nExamples:\n    ai_search(question=\"What were the total sales last quarter?\")\n    ai_search(question=\"Who are the top 10 customers by revenue?\")",
    "input_schema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "question": {
          "description": "Natural language question to search for. Be clear and specific for best results.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "question"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "name": "ai_search"
  },
  "execute_query": {
    "description": "Run an adhoc analytics query against the current workspace and return rows.\n\nWHEN TO CALL:\n- The user asks any data question that needs concrete tabular rows.\n- You have resolved metric / attribute / label identifiers via the discovery tools.\n- You do NOT need a visualization spec (that's ai_chat) or a label-only lookup\n  (that's compute_label_elements).\n\nFLOW (mirrors ``execute_visualization``):\n1. Translate the AAC ``query`` to an AFM execute body via gooddata-code-convertors.\n2. POST to afm-exec-api to obtain a signed execution result id.\n3. Fetch the Arrow table via afm-exec-api's audited ``/binary`` endpoint.\n\nIDENTIFIER FORMAT:\n- ``fields[X].using`` and ``attribute_filter.using`` / ``date_filter.using`` /\n  ``text_filter.using`` take TYPED identifiers: ``\"label/<id>\"``, ``\"metric/<id>\"``,\n  ``\"fact/<id>\"``, ``\"dataset/<id>\"``.\n- ``ranking_filter.using``, ``metric_value_filter.using``, ``metric_sort.metrics[i]``,\n  ``attribute_sort.by`` take BARE local identifiers \u2014 the keys you defined in ``fields:``.\n\nA ``ranking_filter`` and a ``metric_value_filter`` cannot coexist in one query \u2014 the\nbackend rejects the pair unless ``enableRankingWithMvf`` is on, and it is off by default.\n\nReturns:\n    ExecutionDataResponse \u2014 same shape as ``execute_visualization`` and\n    ``fetch_execution_data``.\n\nRaises:\n    ValidationError: Query rejected by Pydantic / gooddata-code-convertors.\n    NotFoundError: Referenced workspace object missing, or the result is no\n      longer available.\n    ServiceError: For any other backend failure.\n\nExample (top 4 Customer City by Net Sales filtered by Customer State = California):\n    execute_query(\n      query={\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"city\": {\"using\": \"label/customer_city\"},\n          \"net_sales\": {\"using\": \"metric/net_sales\"}\n        },\n        \"filter_by\": {\n          \"state\": {\"type\": \"attribute_filter\", \"using\": \"label/customer_state\",\n                    \"state\": {\"include\": [\"California\"]}},\n          \"top4\":  {\"type\": \"ranking_filter\", \"using\": \"net_sales\", \"top\": 4}\n        },\n        \"sort_by\": [{\"type\": \"metric_sort\", \"direction\": \"DESC\", \"metrics\": [\"net_sales\"]}]\n      },\n      limit=4\n    )",
    "input_schema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "limit": {
          "default": 50,
          "description": "Maximum rows to return (default: 50).",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 10000,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "offset": {
          "default": 0,
          "description": "Skip N rows for pagination (default: 0).",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "output_format": {
          "default": "xtab",
          "description": "Output shape: \"xtab\" (default) returns a cross-tab with separate row_labels and a metric data matrix; \"rows\" returns named-dict rows.",
          "enum": [
            "xtab",
            "rows"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        "query": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "AAC query (fields + optional filter_by + sort_by) describing the analytics request. The `using` of a field or attribute/date/text filter must be a TYPED workspace identifier \u2014 e.g. \"label/customer_city\", \"metric/net_sales\", \"fact/return_volume\", \"dataset/order_date\". Local references \u2014 ranking_filter.using, metric_value_filter.using, metric_sort.metrics, attribute_sort.by \u2014 refer to keys in `fields` and stay bare. ranking_filter and metric_value_filter cannot be combined by default; the backend accepts both only when enableRankingWithMvf is enabled. Resolve identifiers via list_workspace_metrics / list_workspace_attributes / ai_search; see knowledge topic `execute-query` for worked examples.",
          "properties": {
            "fields": {
              "additionalProperties": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  {
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "aggregation": {
                        "anyOf": [
                          {
                            "enum": [
                              "SUM",
                              "AVG",
                              "MIN",
                              "MAX",
                              "MEDIAN",
                              "COUNT"
                            ],
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "null"
                          }
                        ],
                        "default": null
                      },
                      "using": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "using"
                    ],
                    "type": "object"
                  },
                  {
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "using": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "using"
                    ],
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "type": "object"
            },
            "filter_by": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "additionalProperties": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "state": {
                            "anyOf": [
                              {
                                "additionalProperties": false,
                                "properties": {
                                  "include": {
                                    "items": {
                                      "type": "string"
                                    },
                                    "minItems": 1,
                                    "type": "array"
                                  }
                                },
                                "required": [
                                  "include"
                                ],
                                "type": "object"
                              },
                              {
                                "additionalProperties": false,
                                "properties": {
                                  "exclude": {
                                    "items": {
                                      "type": "string"
                                    },
                                    "minItems": 1,
                                    "type": "array"
                                  }
                                },
                                "required": [
                                  "exclude"
                                ],
                                "type": "object"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "type": {
                            "const": "attribute_filter",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "using": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "type",
                          "using",
                          "state"
                        ],
                        "type": "object"
                      },
                      {
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "from": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "to": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "type": {
